  V2. Reproduction harness added: src/test/java/project/stockrecommendationengine/rag/evaluation/TraceReproductionFilesTests.java (opt-in on
      -Drag.reproduction.run). It reads the run file (row_to_json export) into a RetrievalEvaluation the way RetrievalEvaluationRepository's row mapper
      reads a row (results as StoredResults, properties as a map), calls the committed TraceReproductionCheck.problems(reference, run) unchanged, writes
      "problems=<n>" and every problem to -Drag.reproduction.out, then TraceReproductionCheck.assertReproduces (exit 1 on any problem).
      Command used for every run below:
        ./mvnw -q -o test -Dtest=TraceReproductionFilesTests -Drag.reproduction.reference=<counterpart file> -Drag.reproduction.run=<traced row file>
            -Drag.reproduction.out=<measurement>/reproduction-<id>.txt
