Per-run procedure (one application start per run; a scratch script ran these commands in this order)
  1. Run shell: cd <project>; set -a; source .env; set +a; export SERVER_PORT=8082 INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN=<42-character token> RAG_CROSS_ENCODER_ENABLED=true
     plus the run's overrides; env | grep '^(RAG_[A-Z0-9_]*|RECOMMENDATION_ENABLED|OUTCOMES_ENABLED|IBKR_ENABLED|WATCHLIST_ENABLED|SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE)='
     printed (in run 295 the pattern lacked [A-Z0-9_]* after RAG_ and printed nothing; fixed from run 296 on; run 295's overrides are shown by its startup
     line and stored properties below). lsof -nP -iTCP:8082 -sTCP:LISTEN: 0 listeners before every start.
  2. CPU sharing wait: ps -ax -o pid=,args= filtered on surefire|spring-boot:run|StockRecommendationEngineApplication, excluding processes whose cwd
     (lsof -a -p <pid> -d cwd) is inside java-projects-m4a; poll every 30 s, up to 30 minutes. Checked before the app start and before the evaluate call.
     (Checked with two probe processes named *surefire-probe: the one with cwd java-projects was reported, the one with cwd java-projects-m4a was not.)
  3. nohup ./mvnw -q -o spring-boot:run > app.log 2>&1 &; wait for "Started StockRecommendationEngineApplication"; the "Cross-encoder loaded ... scoring=" line.
  4. Warm-up: curl -X POST http://localhost:8082/api/rag/retrieve -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" -H 'Content-Type: application/json'
       -d '{"ticker":"NVDA","query":"What was NVIDIA gross margin in fiscal 2026?","rerank":true}'
  5. CPU sharing wait (step 2), then sysctl -n vm.loadavg, then
       curl --max-time 1200 -X POST "http://localhost:8082/api/rag/evaluate?<query>" -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>"
  6. docker exec -i trading-postgres psql -U "$POSTGRES_USER" -d "$POSTGRES_DB" -tA -c "select row_to_json(e) from retrieval_evaluations e where id = <id>"
     -> snapshot-<id>-traced-<counterpart file name>.json (the single psql output line, with its newline).
  7. curl -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" http://localhost:8082/api/rag/evaluate/<id>/evidence -> HTTP 200 application/json, indented by the application's
     Jackson setting (spring.jackson.serialization.indent-output true). evidence-<id>.json is that body with whitespace outside strings removed (one line plus a newline);
     a script checked the compact file parses equal to the fetched body with every number kept as written.
  8. grep -E 'Cross-encoder scoring completed|Reranking failed|Retrieval evaluation stored|WARN|ERROR' app.log -> scoring-<id>.txt.
  9. Stop: kill the port-8082 listener JVM, the mvnw process, and its child processes (by pid, so no process of another worktree is signalled); then
     lsof on 8082 -> 0 listeners, mvnw not alive, no spring-boot:run or application process with cwd in java-projects-m4a.
  10. After the stop and before the next run's step 1: the harness command (V2) and the F5 extraction script on evidence-<id>.json.

